  "methodology_footnotes": [
    "Influence scale: high = 4, medium = 3, low = 2, minimal = 1. Self-credit is ChatGPT→ChatGPT when ChatGPT wrote the Unified Brief. Peers→ChatGPT is the mean of Sonnet, Gemini, and Grok rating ChatGPT’s contribution (excluding self). Stored modes stay open / blind / reassigned; open displays as Revealed. Blind is the default product path.",
    "Civitas is harness batch db9445cf-ef02-5740-b69f-d34a1194e04a, stored as civitas-replication (not retagged). On 2026-07-27, structured OpenAI calls were sent reasoning_effort = “low” with a 4,096-token cap. Anthropic and xAI also received 4,096-token caps but were sent no effort setting at all; Gemini’s structured-output client floor made its effective cap 8,192. Think-tank: gpt-5.5, claude-sonnet-4-6, gemini-3.6-flash, grok-4.3.",
    "The Sol-era control is harness batch bc243273-6103-470c-9f11-94943925ca95 (multi-demo-authorship). Contribution analyses sent reasoning_effort = “low” to every provider, with an 8,192-token cap for ChatGPT and 16,384 for the others — headroom for providers whose reasoning shares the output ceiling. It also used newer models and five demos rather than five repetitions of Civitas, so the comparison is descriptive rather than a clean causal estimate of effort or tokens."
